# AXIS CELL: scrutinee type = NON-ENUM (int) x consumer = the DIVERGENCE gate
# (`live_stmt_diverges`'s `SMatch` arm in self_host_typechecker/typecheck.gg).
# It samples nothing about the two `safety_commit` JOIN consumers — those are
# `s5_join_int_nonexh.gg` and `n2_nested_uam.gg`.
#
# `n` is neither 1 nor 2, so control falls straight OUT of the `match` even
# though every arm `return`s. The join after the `if` is therefore REACHED with
# `s` still moved, and `print(s)` is a use-after-move. `gg check` rejects this
# with `error[E_UseAfterMove]`; the self-host must too.
#
# RED-VERIFY (pre-fix HEAD): before the divergence gate consulted
# `match_has_catch_all`, an all-arms-diverging `match` was credited as diverging
# whatever its arms covered, the fall-through path vanished, and this program was
# ACCEPTED AND LOWERED -- measured rc 0, 4155 bytes of C.
void sink(String ^x):
    pass

void probe(int n, bool c):
    String s = "hello"
    if c:
        sink(^s)
        match n:
            case 1:
                return
            case 2:
                return
    print(s)

void main():
    probe(3, true)
